      "pali": "Visāradasutta ",
      "english": "Assured "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Dasahi, bhikkhave, dhammehi samannāgatā upāsikā avisāradā agāraṁ ajjhāvasati. ",
      "english": "“A laywoman living at home with these ten qualities is not self-assured. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Katamehi dasahi? ",
      "english": "What ten? "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Pāṇātipātinī hoti … ",
      "english": "She kills living creatures. … "
    },
    {
